# Markdown Files (Ignore all .md files except README)
# ========================
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md

# Agent instruction files — local working notes, not project docs.
# Deliberately placed AFTER the block above, because git applies the LAST
# matching pattern: stated here, these stay ignored even if the *.md rule is
# later relaxed to start committing documentation. A pattern with no slash
# matches at any depth, so nested copies are covered too.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
GEMINI.md
AGENTS.md

